WEBVTT

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.680
<b>Sel... fish!</b>

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.770
<b>I couldn't protect anything...</b>

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.130
<b>Not a thing...</b>

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:37.210
<b>Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!</b>

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.680
<b>The world is like a merry-go-round</b>

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.550
<b>Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1</b>

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.580
<b>Every day it sparkles</b>

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.250
<b>Dokidoki Precure</b>

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:55.160
<b>I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before</b>

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.830
<b>My heart races and I greet the scenery around me</b>

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:06.470
<b>The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day</b>

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:11.910
<b>Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed</b>

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:17.620
<b>If your friends are in trouble</b>

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:26.490
<b>isn't it normal to help them?</b>

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.160
<b>Happy lucky Precure</b>

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.560
<b>Only Precure makes my heart pound</b>

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.400
<b>Our happy love will change the world</b>

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.200
<b>What's more than just cute</b>

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.070
<b>is our promise between girls</b>

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:46.110
<b>I will fight for you and believe in you</b>

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:52.020
<b>Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure</b>

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.160
<b>Take a look, everyone.</b>

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:02.060
<b>This is the Tokyo Clover Tower that was just finished last year.</b>

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.400
<b>It's 999 meters tall!</b>

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:08.000
<b>It's the tallest broadcasting tower in the world.</b>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.970
<b>Wow, it's huge!</b>

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.100
<b>Man, it's crazy big up close!</b>

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.010
<b>Now then, you're free to walk around until 2 P.M.</b>

