<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:36.130
<b>Our student council president is extremely reliable.</b>

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.060
<b>President?</b>

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:47.040
<b>The Earth's in Danger! 

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:47.040
<b>The Earth's in Danger! 

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.740
<b>What'djoo say, punk? {Alternate, more literal translation: "Nigger nig nig"}</b>

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.240
<b>You callin' me a punk, punk?</b>

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.410
<b>President!</b>

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.280
<b>Nikaido is picking a fight with students from another school!</b>

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.880
<b>President!</b>

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.120
<b>I think Yashima got carsick on the ride here!</b>

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.520
<b>President!</b>

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.420
<b>Mimura lost his wallet!</b>

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:05.960
<b>She's fast!</b>

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.130
<b>Almost a national record!</b>

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.460
<b>Mimura!</b>

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:10.360
<b>Huh?</b>

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.260
<b>Here's your lost wallet.</b>

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.630
<b>So don't worry.</b>

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.640
<b>Thanks, you're a lifesaver!</b>

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.410
<b>It was kind of hot in that bus, huh?</b>

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.680
<b>It's a bit cooler here, so take a break.</b>

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.650
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.290
<b>Nikaido, what are you fighting over?</b>

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.490
<b>Th-These punks just bumped into me!</b>

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:39.590
<b>Nuh-uh, you did!</b>

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.430
<b>Stop!</b>

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:45.900
<b>If you all fight over something so tiny,</b>

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.870
<b>that ginormous Clover Tower will laugh in your face.</b>

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.540
<b>Who the punk are you?</b>

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.440
<b>Why, hello there!</b>

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.940
<b>I'm the student council president of Oogai First Middle School,</b>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.010
<b>Aida Mana!</b>

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.480
<b>Talk about loud!</b>

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.250
<b>And a handshake to show we're friends!</b>

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.220
<b>It's a pleasure to meet you! {Eh, I don't like using it twice, but I'm not sure how else to go about this stock phrase.}</b>

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.090
<b>S-Sure...</b>

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:12.490
<b>A pleasure to meet you, too!</b>

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:14.560
<b>We're friends!</b>

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.260
<b>She tamed those beasts in the blink of an eye!</b>

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:20.300
<b>Our president's as reliable as ever!</b>

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:24.070
<b>Aida, please reconsider our offer.</b>

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.970
<b>Please join our club! {Well, "lend your strength", but that's too wordy.}</b>

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.670
<b>Okay, sure!</b>

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.840
<b>Mana!</b>

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.440
<b>Rikka!</b>

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:32.280
<b>You've got enough work with the student council!</b>

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.120
<b>Why do people like you <i>always</i> try to solve everyone's problems?</b>

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.850
<b>The lost and found can handle lost items.</b>

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:46.090
<b>The health representative can handle carsick kids. {Not sure if there's an official translation for 保健委員}</b>

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:51.060
<b>And there's certainly no need for you to stop a fight yourself.</b>

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.370
<b>You're the student council president after all,</b>

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.300
<b>so learn to say no...</b>

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.870
<b>Huh? Mana?</b>

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:58.640
<b>If you're looking for Aida,</b>

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:01.940
<b>she's watching over a lost child over there.</b>

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.280
<b>Let me show you a good luck charm.</b>

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:09.850
<b>Just draw a heart in your palm like this, and make a wish.</b>

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.320
<b>"I hope I find my mommy."</b>

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.150
<b>Heart?</b>

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:16.720
<b>Yeah. And when you do—</b>

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.920
<b>Michiko!</b>

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.720
<b>Mommy!</b>

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:20.860
<b>Mommy!</b>

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.860
<b>Michiko...</b>

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.700
<b>Thank you, lady!</b>

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.000
<b>Sure!</b>

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.570
<b>Oh, Mana...</b>

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.340
<b>Why do you try to help other people so much?</b>

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.740
<b>Well, when I see other people looking happy,</b>

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.310
<b>it makes me happy too!</b>

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:42.080
<b>Mana, you're spreading your love too thin.</b>

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:44.420
<b>Whoah!</b>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.780
<b>What is it now?</b>

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.290
<b>That's Makopi, isn't it?!</b>

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.360
<b>Who?</b>

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.160
<b>A celebrity?</b>

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.490
<b>You don't know her?</b>

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.060
<b>It's Kenzaki Makoto!</b>

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.600
<b>Mixed with the flavors of nature.</b>

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.500
<b>And no caffeine to make your body shine.</b>

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.440
<b>Ace Tea.</b>

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.740
<b>Let's drink together!</b>

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:20.150
Let's drink 
together!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:20.150
Let's drink 
together!

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.510
<b>I see, so she's an idol who's all the rage right now.</b>

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:12.640
<b>I've seen those before.</b>

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:16.150
<b>But I've never seen a celebrity in the flesh before!</b>

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:18.150
<b>She's so cute!</b>

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.020
<b>Her face is so petite!</b>

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.150
<b>Wait, Mana!</b>

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.850
<b>Excuse us! Please let us through!</b>

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.160
<b>Don't push!</b>

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.600
<b>Now, hurry!</b>

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.900
<b>It's dangerous, so don't push!</b>

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.210
<b>Excuse me!</b>

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:42.870
<b>U-Um...</b>

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.080
<b>We're too busy for you.</b>

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.010
<b>An autograph can—</b>

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:45.940
<b>You dropped something.</b>

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.160
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:05.600
<b>What's wrong, Makoto?</b>

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.300
<b>You're acting strange.</b>

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:09.900
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:12.270
<b>I'm fine now.</b>

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.770
<b>I heard it! {I don't think I'm a good enough translator to keep the gobi in.}</b>

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.240
<b>That was the dark heartbeat of a Selfish!</b>

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:21.950
<b>So the Selfish have come to this world too?</b>

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.380
<b>We have to hurry and find the star of hope!</b>

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.050
<b>We have to find our final trump card! {Get it, because all of the cures have a playing card motif? See: Episode title screen.}</b>

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:30.760
<b>This is serious!</b>

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:34.730
<b>Ah, Makopi thanked me!</b>

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:37.530
<b>My heart's never beaten so fast in my life! {Here come the yuri goggles.}</b>

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.130
<b>Excuse me, my blissful looking lady.</b>

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:40.830
<b>Wha?</b>

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.100
<b>I have some accessories that would look perfect on you.</b>

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.570
<b>Would you like to take a look?</b>

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.010
<b>Oh...</b>

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.040
<b>Hi there!</b>

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.010
<b>Wow,</b>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.010
<b>they're great!</b>

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.620
<b>This is cute!</b>

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.160
<b>Ma'am, you have an eye for quality.</b>

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.930
<b>That's a curio known as the Cure Lovies.</b>

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:08.660
<b>Cure Lovies?</b>

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.030
<b>It looks like what Makopi was wearing...</b>

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:33.650
<b>Huh?</b>

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.330
<b>You seem to like it.</b>

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.830
<b>You can have it if you want.</b>

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:45.530
<b>What? But I couldn't!</b>

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.970
<b>My grandfather always told me that you never get something for nothing!</b>

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.940
<b>The one who prices an item can change it if he wants.</b>

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:58.280
<b>Mana!</b>

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.040
<b>Rikka!</b>

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.110
<b>Geez, where have you been?</b>

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:05.080
<b>If we don't hurry, we'll miss our chance to see the viewing platform!</b>

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:06.620
<b>You're right.</b>

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.120
<b>Anyway, thank you very much!</b>

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.590
<b>Enjoy it, my sweet heart.</b>

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.130
<b>Talk about a line!</b>

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.830
<b>And it's all because you wandered off on your own.</b>

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.130
<b>Sorry about that...</b>

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.840
<b>Man, how nice of 'em to line up.</b>

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:29.040
<b>It's gonna take hours to reach the viewing platform.</b>

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:32.380
<b>If we cut in line, we can cut that time to zero!</b>

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.550
<b>Nikaido! Over here!</b>

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.920
<b>Wanna line up?</b>

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:42.620
<b>That's right, the longer you wait with everyone,</b>

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.760
<b>the greater the impact it'll have!</b>

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:58.340
<b>We have arrived, Madam.</b>

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.040
<b>Good day.</b>

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:06.810
<b>Now then, allow me to show you to the viewing platform on the top floor.</b>

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.950
<b>Huh? Madam!</b>

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.680
<b>Madam! What are you doing there?</b>

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.990
<b>Waiting in line.</b>

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:19.560
<b>People who want to visit the viewing platform must do this, correct?</b>

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:24.530
<b>There is no need for you, the owner of this tower, to wait in line!</b>

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.930
<b>The longer you wait, the greater the impact it will have.</b>

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.000
<b>I feel Mana would say the same thing.</b>

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.400
<b>M-Mana?</b>

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.870
<b>A dear friend of mine.</b>

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.380
<b>We're almost there.</b>

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:41.980
<b>It's that lady!</b>

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:43.580
<b>Michiko!</b>

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:44.720
<b>Have fun!</b>

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.650
<b>I will! {lel epick 4chan references}</b>

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:52.620
<b>How long do I have to wait?</b>

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:57.260
<b>If only I could ditch the line and cut in front...</b>

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.270
<b>But I guess I can't do that.</b>

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.210
<b>Sure you can.</b>

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:09.610
<b>Wh-Who's there?!</b>

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.840
<b>Don't hold back.</b>

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.050
<b>Release the darkness in your heart.</b>

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.230
<b>What happened?</b>

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.460
<b>Somebody passed out!</b>

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:30.930
<b>Are you all right?</b>

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.730
<b>Not bad!</b>

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.670
<b>This should give birth to an excellent Selfish!</b>

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.370
<b>Run wild!</b>

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.340
<b>Release the darkness in your heart!</b>

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:51.550
<b>Selfish!</b>

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:01.060
<b>{part b}</b>

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.240
<b>Line!</b>

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.040
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.480
<b>What the crab is that?</b>

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.940
<b>This is absurd!</b>

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.450
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.950
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.180
<b>Run even wilder!</b>

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.720
<b>That's...</b>

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.250
<b>A Selfish!</b>

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.590
<b>We're too late!</b>

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:33.490
<b>My, what a large crab.</b>

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:37.930
<b>Sebastian, perhaps we could raise him at home? {Oh hey, Sebastian + crab}</b>

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.130
<b>We could not. Now, this way.</b>

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.330
<b>Thank you all for waiting!</b>

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.870
<b>Selfyselfy Selfish!</b>

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.410
<b>Get outtaouttaoutta the way!</b>

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.080
<b>It's headed for the viewing platform?</b>

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.350
<b>Michiko...</b>

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.030
<b>Sharu!</b>

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.030
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:18.440
<b>Michiko...</b>

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.910
<b>Michiko's in danger!</b>

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.740
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:36.490
<b>All guests, please take turns enjoying the scenery in an orderly fashion.</b>

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:42.360
<b>To heck with bein' orderly!</b>

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.040
<b>I'll save you...</b>

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.720
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.920
<b>This view is all mine!</b>

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:11.020
<b>Michiko!</b>

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:11.520
<b>Mommy!</b>

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.690
<b>Cutting!</b>

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:21.600
<b>Lady...</b>

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.670
<b>Are you all right?</b>

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.700
<b>Michiko!</b>

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.670
<b>Hurry!</b>

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.740
<b>Take Michiko and run away!</b>

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.870
<b>What about you?</b>

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.440
<b>I'll be just fine!</b>

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.540
<b>Now, get going!</b>

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:32.810
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.310
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.650
<b>I'm beat.</b>

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.790
<b>I can't move a muscle.</b>

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.050
<b>But...</b>

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.360
<b>this really is a great view!</b>

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:50.700
<b>Right?</b>

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.570
<b>This view is all mine!</b>

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.700
<b>What was that for?</b>

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.210
<b>This view doesn't belong to one person!</b>

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.840
<b>It's for everyone!</b>

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.950
<b>It's too selfish to say you want it all for yourself!</b>

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.650
<b>She's scolding that Selfish!</b>

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.850
<b>I can't believe it!</b>

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:14.620
<b>She's...</b>

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.160
<b>Now, you may be a crab,</b>

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:23.690
<b>but even crabs are better off making friends with people!</b>

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:23.690
<b>Sharuru!</b>

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.500
<b>You over there!</b>

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.060
<b>Who?</b>

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.130
<b>Down here!</b>

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:31.540
<b>I'm a fairy from the Trump Kingdom, Sharuru!</b>

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.740
<b>Oh, hello. I'm Aida Mana.</b>

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.440
<b>She accepted that quickly...</b>

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.210
<b>This girl is definitely no ordinary human!</b>

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.680
<b>I'm used to it.</b>

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:44.250
<b>Use my power!</b>

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:47.220
<b>You can fight the Selfish with it!</b>

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:49.820
<b>By Selfish, do you mean this crab?</b>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.120
<b>Yes, now transform!</b>

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.260
<b>Got it.</b>

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:54.430
<b>Let's give this a shot.</b>

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.660
<b>Transform!</b>

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:04.940
<b>... Huh?</b>

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.640
<b>Trans... form!</b>

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:09.210
